Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:03.98,PRESENT,,0,0,0,,AZALEA FANSUB GROUP PRESENTS
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\fade(00,0)\p1\a5\bord0\1a&H00&\pos(430,206)\fscx807\fscy277}m 0 0 l 0 0 l 92 0 l 92 38 l 0 38
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:03.98,worked,,0,0,0,,{\pos(801,256)}Worked on the series:\N Lily, Tiramisu, Biryulka, Host, February
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:03.98,title,,0,0,0,,{\fscx75\fscy75\pos(846,392)}How I became
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:03.98,name,,0,0,0,,{\fscx75\fscy75\pos(848,456)}queen
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.06,2:01:37.06,PRESENT,,0,0,0,,{\fs40\pos(1181,4)}AZALEA
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.03,0:01:06.53,Default,,0,0,0,,All characters are fictitious,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.53,0:01:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,and the events shown are fiction.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.18,0:01:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Did Hong find out anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.01,0:01:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Apparently, Kim Byungin guessed
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.98,0:01:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,that the piece of fabric he found was from the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.02,0:02:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,He's getting closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.05,0:02:02.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s hurry up too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.85,0:02:32.35,Default,,0,0,0,,-We are learning not to attack.\N-Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.49,0:02:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.19,0:02:43.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Losing your mind is not in your rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.46,0:02:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been holding back for too long,\Nand I'm tired of waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.21,0:03:06.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Dangerous Liaisons
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.95,0:03:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,,8 episode
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.38,0:03:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.35,0:03:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.83,0:03:51.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you go hunting?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.43,0:03:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,As they say: "Rest..."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.40,0:04:00.57,Default,,0,0,0,,"Rest and wait until they get tired."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.84,0:04:03.64,Default,,0,0,0,,While I rest, my enemies get tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.61,0:04:06.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.11,0:04:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,But how did you catch the hare without a bow?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.28,0:04:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The bow made my hands and fingers hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.12,0:04:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m sure it wasn’t invented for hunting,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.62,0:04:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,but to torture people.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.46,0:04:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Although, if your hands and fingers hurt after it,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.20,0:04:28.93,Default,,0,0,0,,then it’s just right for hunting people.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.34,0:04:35.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Animals are easier to trap in any case.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.57,0:04:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s dangerous for you to hunt with just the two of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.74,0:04:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Guards must guard you wherever you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.65,0:04:46.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Next time I’ll take her with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.15,0:04:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, you still hold the post of head of the king’s guard?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.76,0:04:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,When the queen's father gets better,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.42,0:04:56.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I will relinquish this responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.13,0:04:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.46,0:05:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,For your health -
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.20,0:05:02.37,Default,,0,0,0,,accept.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.37,0:05:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything is fine. No need.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.40,0:05:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t refuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.30,0:05:09.11,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a gift from the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.01,0:05:11.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.15,0:05:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you heard - the queen has woken up?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.42,0:05:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.85,0:05:25.39,Default,,0,0,0,,How is she feeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.56,0:05:28.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Fortunately, Her Majesty is healthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.76,0:05:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,She coped with the illness.\NWhat a relief.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.83,0:05:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I must see Her Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.37,0:05:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.61,0:05:51.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Now is not the time for visits.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.48,0:05:53.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Since the queen is better off,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.15,0:05:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,we avoided the worst outcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.92,0:05:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll look for the accounting book myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.92,0:05:58.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.66,0:06:01.99,Default,,0,0,0,,This will only alert them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.33,0:06:04.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep an eye on everything that happens in the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.34,0:06:20.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice weather today.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.31,0:06:22.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You won’t catch it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.82,0:06:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The smell of spring.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.56,0:06:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you marry me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.86,0:06:42.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I may not have come out face-first,\Nbut I have a goat.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.30,0:06:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I don’t know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.27,0:06:51.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.59,0:07:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I really wanted her to come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.19,0:07:09.83,Default,,0,0,0,,And only her memories returned.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.39,0:07:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,They used to appear like flashes here and there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.66,0:07:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Every time I had a headache and a ringing in my ears.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.93,0:07:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,But this time the memories appeared without special effects.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.94,0:07:25.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Honyoung, you will be 19 this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.04,0:07:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,But your name is not Hongyeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.48,0:07:30.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Hon is a surname, and your name is Yeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.32,0:07:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,My sense of smell.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.38,0:07:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Smells help you remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.49,0:07:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,But why
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.82,0:07:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,am I playing that well?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.76,0:07:44.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You have played the gayageum since childhood.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.80,0:07:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Your memory is back,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.40,0:07:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,here the talents have awakened.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.81,0:07:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.47,0:08:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,When I was a vegetable, everything went wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.28,0:08:02.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.85,0:08:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is it that the voice in your head became female?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.02,0:08:11.05,Default,,0,0,0,,What am I,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.92,0:08:13.19,Default,,0,0,0,,lost your voice?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.76,0:08:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.52,0:08:17.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I can hear you perfectly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.83,0:08:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The strength returned to my fingers,\Nbut my voice was gone. Just like
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.57,0:08:23.80,Default,,0,0,0,,in "The Little Mermaid"?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.13,0:08:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Figure it out so that there is no doubt about the words of the witness,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.94,0:08:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,who sold arsenic to the court lady Khan
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.14,0:08:35.04,Default,,0,0,0,,like poison for mice, and how the poison got into the king’s kitchen.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.55,0:08:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I have business with the head of the Detective Department.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.06,0:08:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,How strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.26,0:08:50.33,Default,,0,0,0,,The palace has always been big,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.16,0:08:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,but today it is especially huge and empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.93,0:08:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Her Majesty is coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.59,0:09:28.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.93,0:09:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I agreed to give the Queen Mother some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.74,0:09:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,-What?\N-That’s the order
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.30,0:09:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,courtyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.81,0:09:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll wait for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.81,0:09:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,But prepare all the evidence,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.41,0:09:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,to use them at any time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.35,0:09:45.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep them secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.61,0:09:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe we were able to piece together the whole picture,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.58,0:09:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,but the Queen Mother may be connected
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.42,0:09:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,with those who want to harm the queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.69,0:09:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,If we leave her alone,\NHer Majesty may be in danger again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.26,0:09:58.23,Default,,0,0,0,,People who want to harm the queen?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.29,0:10:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The Queen admitted that she wanted to kill herself by throwing herself into the pond.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.16,0:10:04.37,Default,,0,0,0,,This time her health failed her.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.47,0:10:06.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What are we talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.71,0:10:16.25,Default,,0,0,0,,She became a target as soon as she crossed the threshold of the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.25,0:10:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what worries me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.58,0:10:19.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.08,0:10:22.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Organize a meeting without a king -
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.99,0:10:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,what a headache.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.92,0:10:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.09,0:10:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Did something happen to His Majesty?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.12,0:10:30.13,Default,,0,0,0,,He went to the queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.36,0:10:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.30,0:10:35.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Benin!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.93,0:10:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn’t know you were here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.30,0:10:41.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You can continue.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.94,0:10:43.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Good for you to get home.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.21,0:10:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s midday,\Nwhy are you sending him home?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.58,0:10:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't sleep all night, so I got it wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.18,0:10:56.39,Default,,0,0,0,,What were you working on, since you confuse day with night?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.39,0:10:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I was on a secret mission all night.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.16,0:11:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I suffered such fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.23,0:11:07.03,Default,,0,0,0,,So, did you learn anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.03,0:11:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Benin, I'm lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.77,0:11:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Fell in love with a woman I shouldn’t have.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.70,0:11:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,And who is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.04,0:11:18.74,Default,,0,0,0,,For some reason, the palace is especially empty today,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.74,0:11:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,empty and in my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.51,0:11:23.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I kept wondering what was wrong with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.95,0:11:26.85,Default,,0,0,0,,And now in the palace there is only
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.22,0:11:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,one woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.82,0:11:31.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Her Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.65,0:11:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I've fallen in love with the queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.56,0:11:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,,-What?\N-How could I fall in love with my sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.83,0:11:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,This is against the law on incest.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.43,0:11:40.63,Default,,0,0,0,,We are from the same family.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.63,0:11:43.53,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the same as incest.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.53,0:11:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,As if this were not enough - she is a stranger and married to the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.94,0:11:48.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.94,0:11:51.94,Default,,0,0,0,,No, that's putting it mildly,\NI lost all my brains on the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.21,0:11:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if you forget about all this,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.24,0:11:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,more importantly -
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.64,0:11:58.51,Default,,0,0,0,,she is much older than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.58,0:12:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this normal?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.28,0:12:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you still worried about her age?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.35,0:12:04.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you yelling at me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.39,0:12:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You are talking outright nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.79,0:12:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.56,0:12:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I won’t say anything more.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.43,0:12:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,No, everything is fine.\NSorry for yelling.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.72,0:12:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You never raised your voice at me,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.50,0:12:18.47,Default,,0,0,0,,and I’ve never been angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.70,0:12:20.67,Default,,0,0,0,,After your appointment, you have changed a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.90,0:12:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got enough to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.67,0:12:24.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I wasn’t angry at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.81,0:12:29.01,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you even come to this conclusion?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.08,0:12:32.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything around reminds of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.02,0:12:35.45,Default,,0,0,0,,How she held the Queen's umbrella,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.55,0:12:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,as she remained next to her,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.72,0:12:41.39,Default,,0,0,0,,as she ran with the decoction for Her Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.52,0:12:44.79,Default,,0,0,0,,All I can think about is Hong Young, the queen’s lady-in-waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.70,0:12:48.63,Default,,0,0,0,,If you think about Hong Young,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.63,0:12:50.53,Default,,0,0,0,,why did you decide that you fell in love with the queen?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.57,0:12:51.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you forgotten who I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.83,0:12:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I am the 16th descendant and first son
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.34,0:12:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,for 3 generations in the family of judges.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.84,0:12:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Kim Hwan.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.24,0:12:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I fall in love with some court lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.48,0:13:01.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Therefore, I am sure that in my heart...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.85,0:13:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Have I fallen in love with a court lady?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.82,0:13:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Good luck to you on the thorny path of love.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.80,0:13:23.70,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Initial instructions for children
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.84,0:13:33.71,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,Cho Hwajin
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.76,0:13:54.83,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.13,0:14:00.37,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Where is the king?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.67,0:14:02.47,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,He went to the queen's house.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.14,0:14:05.41,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Why so suddenly?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.41,0:14:07.11,Default,Spillie,0,0,0,,The Queen regained consciousness.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.21,0:14:09.95,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,He wants to take the opportunity to search her house.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.95,0:14:15.22,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Are you hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.22,0:14:17.49,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.83,0:14:24.63,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Then I will also visit the queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.97,0:14:39.58,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,To what do I owe such pleasure?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.46,0:14:57.99,Default,Spillie,0,0,0,,Skinny,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.73,0:15:00.43,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,thick,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.73,0:15:03.13,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,high
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.60,0:15:04.90,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,and low.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.67,0:15:07.67,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,Everyone is of different size and height.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.67,0:15:10.87,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,But they all have one thing in common.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.27,0:15:12.31,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,This
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.01,0:15:15.08,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.25,0:15:19.85,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,You have the best vision and aim.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.18,0:15:23.19,Default,Spilyk,0,0,0,,You are the shooters whom I selected personally.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.59,0:15:26.29,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,And I have average height and weight.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.29,0:15:27.96,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Which type am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.96,0:15:29.59,Default,Spilyk,0,0,0,,You will be slow-witted.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.43,0:15:36.13,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,And that’s what I called your squad.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.87,0:15:38.10,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,Les Miserables.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.87,0:15:40.67,Default,Spilyk,0,0,0,,You were sent to the front line,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.67,0:15:43.14,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,because they were considered nonentities.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.51,0:15:45.07,Default,Spilyk,0,0,0,,But with these guns
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.51,0:15:48.18,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,you will become the best warriors of Joseon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.08,0:15:50.75,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.12,0:15:57.12,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,A gun can take a life.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.19,0:16:04.36,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,But also
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.33,0:16:08.76,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,may save her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.47,0:16:11.30,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Line up five in a row to shoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.91,0:16:21.04,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,It’s troublesome, but I have to save this country.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.68,0:16:25.71,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.16,0:16:35.49,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,I came to pick up what I need.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.89,0:16:39.60,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,The first is a hairpin with a phoenix.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.00,0:16:41.80,Default,Spillikin,0,0,0,,Phoenix hairpin?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.66,0:16:44.90,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,A gift for the queen?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.90,0:16:48.37,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,If for the queen,\NI would ask for Saniyvon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.07,0:16:53.88,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,I don’t need a golden royal hairpin with a phoenix.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.41,0:16:56.04,Default,Spillie,0,0,0,,I need the one made of jade.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.85,0:17:00.92,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,But in accordance with royal etiquette, only the queen
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.72,0:17:04.02,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,can wear phoenix hairpins.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.02,0:17:05.29,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.09,0:17:13.46,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,And the second thing I need is...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.93,0:17:21.50,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,I knew it. She wants to seduce the king there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.14,0:17:26.64,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,Rather. We must finish with a bullet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.98,0:17:29.21,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Yes. Quicker.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.28,0:17:36.29,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,Before the queen reveals the secret to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.99,0:17:43.73,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,There is one difference between me and the little mermaid.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.59,0:17:47.80,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,She got legs for her voice, and I got arms.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.26,0:17:50.13,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,Surprise after surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.13,0:17:52.27,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,So will I lose myself drop by drop?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.87,0:17:54.24,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,If I stay here,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.24,0:17:57.77,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,that bastard, Director Khan,\N will get everything he wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.37,0:17:59.98,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,I can accuse his ancestors of treason,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.98,0:18:02.68,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,hunt down the Khans and destroy the entire clan.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.68,0:18:05.58,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,I will destroy three generations of Khans,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.58,0:18:07.18,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,so that they couldn’t conceive him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.18,0:18:11.39,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,But what clan do they belong to?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.99,0:18:14.46,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Why is her mood constantly changing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.30,0:18:22.70,Default,Biryulka,0,0,0,,Are you all from the Namsadan troupe here?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.70,0:18:24.07,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Where do such skills come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.53,0:18:27.67,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,For Joseon women this is nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.94,0:18:30.37,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,This is the only way to look behind the walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.77,0:18:34.61,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,I didn’t know what the deep meaning of this was.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.44,0:18:37.55,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,It’s true. After living here for a week, I realized
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.55,0:18:40.08,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,that the life of a Joseon woman is much harder than I expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.95,0:18:42.78,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,And by the way, I’m also the queen here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.45,0:18:47.92,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,But if I can take bloody revenge...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.46,0:18:49.49,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.49,0:18:54.40,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,Everything will be fine if you don’t smell.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.40,0:18:55.93,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Memories will not return.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.93,0:18:57.47,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,And my voice will return.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.63,0:19:00.60,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,From this day on I will live for revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.94,0:19:03.41,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,And for this I need power.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.87,0:19:04.94,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Hon Young.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.94,0:19:08.34,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,What, as a queen, should I do to gain unprecedented power?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.51,0:19:11.28,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,I know the best way to get power.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.08,0:19:14.12,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Which one?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.12,0:19:17.75,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,Producing an heir will give you the most power.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.86,0:19:20.92,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Production?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.92,0:19:22.72,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,What kind of inhuman word is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.29,0:19:25.39,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.86,0:19:28.46,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,For me, the super-powerful Sunwon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.66,0:19:30.10,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Who is Sunwon?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.37,0:19:32.23,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Such a village name.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.23,0:19:35.07,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,Queen Sunwon. She's the Dowager Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.41,0:19:39.31,Default,Spillie,0,0,0,,Hong Young, if I want to impress her,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.31,0:19:42.14,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,-what do I need...\N-Give birth to an heir. Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.14,0:19:44.61,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,I’ll get her a gift. What could you come up with?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.61,0:19:47.62,Default,Spillikins,0,0,0,,Something small, shiny,\N expensive and beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.45,0:19:50.59,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.12,0:19:54.29,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,That smell...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.83,0:19:59.60,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Memories return, return...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.22,0:20:22.68,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,This storage is called Sky. What's in the backyard is the Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.68,0:20:24.25,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,And what’s next to the guest room is Black?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.25,0:20:26.22,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Yes. Your father accumulated wealth while you were away.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.22,0:20:28.42,Default,Spilyk,0,0,0,,All storages are full.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.42,0:20:31.29,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,Sky, Earth, Black...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.59,0:20:35.16,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,If you think about all the warehouses in Joseon, and not just these...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.16,0:20:37.47,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Your family had to use all Chinese characters.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.20,0:20:41.00,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Oh, my little eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.54,0:20:44.04,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Look, I was born with a golden spoon in my mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.51,0:20:47.54,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,This.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.41,0:20:51.41,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,And this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.78,0:20:54.22,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,And besides them,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.85,0:20:57.32,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,pack everything else.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.59,0:20:59.65,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,Everything else?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.65,0:21:02.06,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Let's take everything and return to the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.99,0:21:05.66,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Your father will have a blow.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.66,0:21:08.53,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,From this day on, I will become the queen of lobbying.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.67,0:21:11.67,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.20,0:21:15.37,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,The King has arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.91,0:21:18.34,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Why is this even necessary?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.04,0:21:20.34,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,I'll be back soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.34,0:21:22.04,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Tell him to wait for me in the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.18,0:21:25.98,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.55,0:21:28.22,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,I need to show my devotion to grandma.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.22,0:21:29.95,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,And stay away from the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.75,0:21:34.16,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.57,0:21:49.57,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,I need to clearly show whose side I’m on.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.57,0:21:50.74,Default,Spillie,0,0,0,,Here he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.04,0:21:54.81,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Why is he in full dress?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.38,0:21:58.08,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,All these royal families are such show-offs.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.48,0:22:00.38,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Show the king your respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.78,0:22:02.85,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Everything is fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.03,0:22:21.60,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,So, I approve Soyeon from the Kim family as queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.18,0:22:29.88,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Congratulations on your election.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.74,0:22:59.04,Default,Spilyk,0,0,0,,Picked it up on the way here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.11,0:23:05.15,Default,Spillie,0,0,0,,My queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.78,0:23:09.78,Default,Spillie,0,0,0,,You blushed. And you breathe faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.59,0:23:12.25,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Are you having difficulty breathing again?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.06,0:23:15.86,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,My face is fine, and I’m breathing normally.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.73,0:23:18.59,Default,Spillie,0,0,0,,Just overeat in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.69,0:23:20.90,Default,Spillie,0,0,0,,Go away, Soyeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.90,0:23:23.17,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Get out of me... That is, get out of this body immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.17,0:23:24.70,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.93,0:23:27.10,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,I have nowhere else to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.10,0:23:29.74,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Is this how you destroy flowers or your body?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.17,0:23:32.51,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Hey, why are you continuing...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.28,0:23:34.91,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,-Enough already.\N-Get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.91,0:23:37.98,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,I won’t give it up, he’s mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.98,0:23:41.35,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,I didn’t know you’d like them so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.02,0:23:43.25,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,I didn’t say I liked it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.25,0:23:45.32,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,I just think it’s better to stay here than to live in a corpse.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.32,0:23:48.62,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,How do you manage to wake up more and more strange?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.59,0:23:52.13,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,I’m not the only one who’s strange here. You have a lot of weird things yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.13,0:23:54.16,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,"Picked them up on the way here"? Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.53,0:23:56.87,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Have they been chasing such a blizzard for a couple of centuries already?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.20,0:23:58.53,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,But I really picked them up on the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.53,0:24:01.17,Default,Spikyulka,0,0,0,,Well, yes, of course, great, bravo.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.17,0:24:03.31,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,It's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.31,0:24:04.74,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,I really believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.41,0:24:07.44,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,The king never lies.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.44,0:24:10.01,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,-Well, yes, well, yes, yeah, yeah.\N-What's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.01,0:24:13.18,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,-How is that? What is it?\N-Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.58,0:24:16.59,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.19,0:24:21.69,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,You blessed our humble abode with your visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.16,0:24:24.39,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Thank you, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.09,0:24:26.96,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Please stand up.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.90,0:24:32.23,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,I had to check on my queen and make sure everything was fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.77,0:24:35.40,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,How are you doing? Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.40,0:24:37.31,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Yes, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.07,0:24:40.44,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Let's go in.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.21,0:24:42.64,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,-Of course.\N-Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.78,0:24:48.08,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,My king, enjoy the hospitality.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.08,0:24:50.29,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,And I need to prepare to return to the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.49,0:24:52.65,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,-Let's go.\N-What? Are you leaving already?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.76,0:24:55.52,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Do you want to go back to the palace today?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.63,0:24:58.33,Default,Spilyk,0,0,0,,I'm recovering quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.73,0:25:00.43,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Even if so,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.06,0:25:04.03,Default,Spilyk,0,0,0,,you just recovered.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.03,0:25:05.67,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,Father is right.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.20,0:25:09.17,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,There is no need to rush, you need to fully recover.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.28,0:25:16.34,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Worried that the courtyard will fight without me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.15,0:25:18.88,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Everything is calm in the courtyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.88,0:25:20.92,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Calmer than when you were in the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.95,0:25:24.32,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Much calmer.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.49,0:25:26.62,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.12,0:25:29.72,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I tried my best,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.79,0:25:33.56,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,but it seems you are unhappy with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.70,0:25:36.13,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,-Yes, I...\N-You are already used to the palace
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.77,0:25:39.00,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,and spend time with my father
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.00,0:25:41.24,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,you don’t like it at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.57,0:25:43.00,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,God.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.77,0:25:48.78,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I focused on fulfilling my queen's duty
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.24,0:25:51.45,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,and I didn’t think about your feelings at all, father.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.08,0:25:55.35,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I will return to the palace tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.05,0:26:01.06,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,If so, I invite you two to the guest house.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.83,0:26:05.93,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Fell for a trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.26,0:26:08.36,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.97,0:26:15.07,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,What fly bit her?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.68,0:26:34.95,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,There is a task for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.35,0:26:38.92,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Bring me something that shouldn’t be.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.06,0:26:47.26,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,From a hiding place in the chambers of the queen's father.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.50,0:26:49.50,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.34,0:26:59.61,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I'm glad to see you here together.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.77,0:27:02.08,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,So happy that I don’t mind dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.54,0:27:05.88,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I should have visited you earlier. \NI'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.75,0:27:08.62,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Nothing to apologize for.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.42,0:27:12.45,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,It’s enough for me to hear,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.92,0:27:18.99,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,how you love each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.96,0:27:25.80,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,My queen is so different from other women,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.80,0:27:28.67,Default,Lilia,0,0,0,,I was always interested to see where she grew up.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.67,0:27:32.41,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,This is the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.71,0:27:34.98,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I raised her alone, without a mother,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.24,0:27:37.08,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,so I tried especially hard
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.08,0:27:39.05,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,give her all the care she needs.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.68,0:27:41.82,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,It must have been hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.32,0:27:44.49,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Well, not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.12,0:27:47.29,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,The Queen did a good job herself
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.32,0:27:49.52,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,from a young age.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.33,0:27:54.86,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Yes, I heard that.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.03,0:27:57.20,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,However, she is so strong and independent,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.37,0:27:59.63,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,for not sharing her feelings with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.03,0:28:01.84,Default,Lily,0,0,0,, Am I so stupid?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.10,0:28:04.41,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Or is it impossible to understand what is on a woman’s mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.91,0:28:08.14,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,It’s terribly difficult for me to understand her.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.14,0:28:11.61,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,God, this is definitely not due to a lack of intelligence.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.75,0:28:13.88,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,All men find it difficult to understand women.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.08,0:28:17.45,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,They are as complex as the teachings of the Buddha.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.52,0:28:19.95,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Don’t try to understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.32,0:28:23.46,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Marital relationships consist of misunderstandings.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.09,0:28:26.43,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,What does this mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.20,0:28:28.70,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,No misunderstandings
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.70,0:28:31.40,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,people wouldn’t get married at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.00,0:28:39.14,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I want to know everything about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.48,0:28:45.05,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.05,0:28:46.61,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I want to see the house,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.61,0:28:48.22,Default,Lilia,0,0,0,,in which she grew up.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.22,0:28:49.52,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Can I do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.95,0:28:52.69,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I'll happily take a walk with the queen and catch up.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.95,0:28:55.49,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,This is an ordinary house of a tradesman.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.49,0:28:56.93,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Nothing special,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.93,0:28:59.86,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,but I'll be happy to show you everything here.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.73,0:29:02.20,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Then go together.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.20,0:29:04.40,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,The Queen must come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.10,0:29:08.64,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,We didn’t see each other for one night,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.37,0:29:11.67,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,but I miss you even when I look at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.04,0:29:15.64,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,You have something stuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.98,0:29:17.71,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,This is a mole.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.85,0:29:23.79,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,It seemed to me that you are different today.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.42,0:29:29.22,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,You should come with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.99,0:29:31.09,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Let's go?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.59,0:29:35.30,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Wait. The two of you take your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.80,0:29:41.54,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I'll check if all the rooms are cleaned.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.08,0:29:48.21,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.01,0:29:53.18,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.25,0:29:54.88,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Distance, don’t you remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.88,0:29:58.89,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,The longer I think, the more meaningful the phrase becomes.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.42,0:30:01.32,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Even if we don’t agree on everything,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.76,0:30:03.86,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,we can coexist happily.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.43,0:30:06.36,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,This is wonderful, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.53,0:30:09.23,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Accepting our differences
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.23,0:30:12.20,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,and overcoming them.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.20,0:30:13.97,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Have you become a philosopher?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.97,0:30:16.24,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Where has “distancing” taken you?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.21,0:30:21.14,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Oh, exactly. After all, you are a politician.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.74,0:30:25.15,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,You saw how happy my father was when he saw us together.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.15,0:30:28.65,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I'm trying to be a good son-in-law, help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.95,0:30:33.25,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.30,0:30:52.44,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,All the servants look unusually strong
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.44,0:30:53.94,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,and dexterous.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.28,0:30:57.08,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,They know the layout of the house like the back of their hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.08,0:30:59.98,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,-Let's go.\N-Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.73,0:31:13.83,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I'm glad I asked you to show everything here.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.90,0:31:18.50,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Of course, there are very valuable things here.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.87,0:31:20.64,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,So. Here, for example.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.40,0:31:24.24,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,White porcelain and folding screen.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.54,0:31:27.28,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I didn’t get them easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.71,0:31:31.95,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Can I take a closer look?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.95,0:31:33.58,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Yes, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.58,0:31:35.45,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Look here...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.46,0:31:43.93,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,There is nothing interesting on the other side.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.19,0:31:47.63,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Even the reverse side of a work of art looks exquisite.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.43,0:31:52.83,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Be careful, queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.60,0:31:56.87,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,-What is it?\N-To your dazzling beauty
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.87,0:31:58.81,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,even the bees are flocking.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.17,0:32:01.81,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,-Bees?\N-Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.81,0:32:03.54,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,-Where?\N-There.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.85,0:32:05.35,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,-Be careful.\N-There are no bees here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.02,0:32:08.35,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,-Where? Where are they?\N-God.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.62,0:32:11.35,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,-Where are they?\N-It looks like they flew away.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.36,0:32:16.56,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,My queen, what can you say about the screen?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.83,0:32:25.50,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Strong strokes, magnificent landscape painting.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.77,0:32:27.20,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Darling, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.97,0:32:32.94,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,You are probably afraid that your valuables may be stolen.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.54,0:32:37.98,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I'm sure you have plenty of guards to guard them at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.88,0:32:42.75,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,No, I don’t have a guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.65,0:32:46.55,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,More like hired guards these days
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.59,0:32:49.46,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,will steal what they are supposed to protect.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.09,0:32:51.26,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Then how?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.43,0:32:54.30,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I have trained several servants who work for me,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.30,0:32:56.46,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,which I trust,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.46,0:32:58.37,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,they perform guard duties.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.37,0:33:01.00,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,It's cheaper than hiring trained guards.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.34,0:33:04.91,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,You are very wise.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.07,0:33:07.28,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,And how many such servants do you have?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.68,0:33:14.55,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,This is classified information.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.25,0:33:19.59,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Then you don't have to tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.06,0:33:22.82,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,However, my queen remains here,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.42,0:33:24.73,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I'm worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.06,0:33:26.49,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,My queen?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.83,0:33:31.97,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,26-27 somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.47,0:33:37.51,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,There can be no secrets between us.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.98,0:33:44.51,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,You have enough people to defend a 9-room estate.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.11,0:33:47.01,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Your words calmed me down.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.62,0:33:49.75,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I doubted whether you had old books,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.75,0:33:51.85,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,dated two centuries earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.42,0:33:56.82,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Money alone is not enough to own such books.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.19,0:33:59.33,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,You will be very surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.69,0:34:02.10,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Really? Surprised?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.20,0:34:09.94,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,On the way to the library you will see
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.94,0:34:11.67,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,the umbrella pine tree I nurtured.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.27,0:34:16.34,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,The shape of its crown resembles a phoenix.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.05,0:34:21.32,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I heard that if you plant a tree,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.32,0:34:23.48,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,a queen will appear in the family.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.12,0:34:27.92,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,The sign worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.92,0:34:30.16,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Almost there. Follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.16,0:34:32.73,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Devil's pine.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.73,0:34:34.76,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,This winter I’ll use it for firewood.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.73,0:34:39.13,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I'm glad to hear your rude and arrogant remarks again.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.74,0:34:42.80,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,At first, when you changed,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.37,0:34:45.07,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I thought you were abusing power.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.81,0:34:47.31,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Thought you were with your relatives
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.81,0:34:49.64,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,trying to trample me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.41,0:34:51.51,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Misunderstanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.85,0:34:53.05,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,And you just...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.15,0:34:55.18,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.62,0:34:57.52,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Just arrogant.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.95,0:35:02.09,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I come from a wealthy family. I can afford it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.79,0:35:05.99,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I wasn’t joking when I said that I want to understand you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.50,0:35:09.10,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I want to know,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.10,0:35:13.60,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,how a woman from a noble family became like you in Joseon.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.84,0:35:16.30,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Don’t even try.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.77,0:35:19.61,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,A woman like me cannot exist in Joseon.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.44,0:35:22.74,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,"I am the most powerful in this world."
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.21,0:35:24.78,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,You are definitely arrogant.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.09,0:35:39.23,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,It hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.61,0:35:52.91,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,The return of the king to the throne after the overthrow
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.91,0:35:54.18,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,The return of the king to the throne after the overthrow
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.27,0:36:21.60,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,What happened to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.87,0:36:25.94,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.38,0:36:28.41,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.41,0:36:32.48,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,His health has deteriorated due to worry about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.68,0:36:35.65,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I will call for help to take you inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.65,0:36:37.35,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Look after him until I get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.10,0:36:50.23,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.00,0:36:52.87,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Did you see a ghost?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.27,0:36:59.61,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,The smell of dampness...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.34,0:37:04.48,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Save me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.48,0:37:07.85,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,It's my fault. I am to blame for the death.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.12,0:37:12.32,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,In this well...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.60,0:37:26.63,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.57,0:37:59.60,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Help the king. Hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.40,0:38:01.97,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Chief concubine?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.10,0:38:04.57,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.91,0:38:06.31,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,You turned pale.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.24,0:38:08.31,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Really...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.95,0:38:13.95,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Father, escort the king inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.35,0:38:20.82,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,It seems the concubine has come to talk to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.46,0:38:23.69,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I came here worried about your health.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.82,0:38:25.83,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,But it seems the king is feeling bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.99,0:38:27.50,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.50,0:38:30.13,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I didn't sleep last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.87,0:38:33.30,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I felt dizzy for a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.30,0:38:35.57,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I will accompany you to the guest house.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.57,0:38:36.87,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,The doctor has already been called.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.37,0:38:39.24,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I don’t need a healer.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.74,0:38:42.31,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I’ll rest and everything will be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.31,0:38:45.55,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,-Faster. Help His Majesty.\N-Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.18,0:38:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Caution.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.13,0:39:03.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.31,0:39:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You can go.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.31,0:39:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you like to lie down?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.35,0:39:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.78,0:39:24.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll sit for a while and rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.05,0:39:32.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard you don’t remember much about your time in Hanyang,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.23,0:39:34.43,Default,,0,0,0,,you were very young then.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.77,0:39:39.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I was still a child then.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.34,0:39:43.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Because of an unpleasant event, I left Hanyang.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.64,0:39:46.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I don’t remember much.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.94,0:39:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What a relief.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.21,0:39:54.05,Default,,0,0,0,,That is, I wanted to say that it’s better to let go
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.05,0:39:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,bad memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.52,0:40:00.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I think so too.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.86,0:40:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,This fool opened Pandora's box.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.40,0:40:12.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You are not what they say.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.73,0:40:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,But I still doubted it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.30,0:40:20.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t worry. I didn't tell him anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.51,0:40:25.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn’t that why you’re here?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.21,0:40:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,And what do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.15,0:40:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You lured him here for a reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.05,0:40:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I really wanted to get along with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.09,0:40:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You were my last hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.66,0:40:39.29,Default,,0,0,0,,While I wanted you,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.29,0:40:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I could be myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.30,0:40:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,But I found out the truth about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.44,0:40:49.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.47,0:40:55.64,Default,,0,0,0,,About you being a fake Kim So-yeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.68,0:41:00.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You called me
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.22,0:41:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,fake?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.49,0:41:05.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I remembered everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.95,0:41:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks more like you showed your true colors.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.36,0:41:14.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I will help you, since my hormones were raging with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.80,0:41:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Confess everything to the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.86,0:41:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It will be painful for him to learn about this from someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.00,0:41:20.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you threatening me?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.54,0:41:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard you clearly.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.98,0:41:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, I brought you some light snacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.69,0:41:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,How difficult it is to reach her.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.62,0:41:42.49,Default,,0,0,0,,She holds on to a complicated relationship,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.49,0:41:45.03,Default,,0,0,0,,so I got confused myself. Spoiled girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.43,0:41:47.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.61,0:42:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.81,0:42:05.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you talked to her yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.38,0:42:08.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave us for a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.92,0:42:13.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.15,0:42:15.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry for making you worry about trifles.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.59,0:42:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,No need for formalities, we are alone here.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.00,0:42:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty,\Nthe queen has fully recovered.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.77,0:42:30.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go back to the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.37,0:42:31.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I can’t.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.61,0:42:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to study something.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.85,0:42:40.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Something to study?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.85,0:42:42.95,Default,,0,0,0,,What exactly?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.45,0:42:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.22,0:42:51.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive me my bad manners.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.29,0:42:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I have prepared a room for you. Let me take you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.83,0:42:58.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I must return to the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.50,0:43:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I’ll be waiting for you in the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.67,0:43:06.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Take care of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.88,0:44:11.35,Default,,0,0,0,,His grandfather was Prince Eunong.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.68,0:44:15.09,Default,,0,0,0,,He was accused of treason, exiled and executed.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.92,0:44:17.35,Default,,0,0,0,,His father was Prince Jeongye.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.35,0:44:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Lived in exile with his father,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.02,0:44:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,sick and died.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.89,0:44:23.69,Default,,0,0,0,,His grandmother and aunt were killed because of their baptism,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.39,0:44:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,and Lee Won-kyung's half-brother
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.00,0:44:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,killed for treason.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.40,0:44:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,This is not a TV show.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.24,0:44:35.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did everyone in his family die?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.68,0:44:43.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you looking at me like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.41,0:44:46.75,Default,,0,0,0,,How do I look?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.62,0:44:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Like I'm a pathetic little dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.05,0:44:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,No need to smile. I'm worried about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.56,0:44:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Apparently, this is why early education only harms.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.36,0:44:59.93,Default,,0,0,0,,What useless knowledge!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.90,0:45:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You. What do you want from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.00,0:45:05.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you stick to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.17,0:45:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What do I want from you?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.81,0:45:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,If the queen suddenly interferes with our plans,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.08,0:45:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I will personally behead her.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.69,0:45:24.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I want you not to interfere with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.96,0:45:28.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You don’t have to help me. Just
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.53,0:45:31.23,Default,,0,0,0,,don’t become my enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.73,0:45:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,And you have a trained eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.40,0:45:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I may not be able to help much with anything,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.64,0:45:40.07,Default,,0,0,0,,but as an enemy I am terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.07,0:45:41.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll grab hold of you and won’t let go.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.61,0:45:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.31,0:45:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Kim Byonin has come to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.83,0:46:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,How many guests do I have today.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.94,0:46:14.77,Default,,0,0,0,,People come to me like I’m going to a restaurant.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.15,0:46:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.65,0:46:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Too good, I would say.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.15,0:46:31.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Any problems?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.66,0:46:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is the head of the Detective Department here?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.96,0:46:36.69,Default,,0,0,0,,While the king and queen are here,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.93,0:46:39.03,Default,,0,0,0,,it should be like a palace here.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.33,0:46:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.33,0:46:44.07,Default,,0,0,0,,From now on, you are under the protection of the Detective Department.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.30,0:46:49.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I brought the royal guards with me, you have nothing to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.21,0:46:53.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you will be under the protection of the royal guards,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.81,0:46:56.55,Default,,0,0,0,,and we will protect the queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.98,0:46:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Are there too many people?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.98,0:47:01.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you can recall the royal guards.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.20,0:47:16.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You are standing in the wrong place.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.07,0:47:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,To protect us,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.10,0:47:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,look around, not at us.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.11,0:47:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Apparently, my destiny is to be surrounded by those who look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.46,0:47:45.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.38,0:48:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.45,0:48:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, this...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.45,0:48:11.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is he here?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.36,0:48:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know him?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.99,0:48:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Come to your senses, wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.13,0:48:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Save me, Benin.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.83,0:48:23.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Benin?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.84,0:48:27.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did he try to attack the queen?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.67,0:48:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,She could have gotten hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.74,0:48:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Go away, woman! Get out of this body!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.74,0:48:34.51,Default,,0,0,0,,-Go away.\N-Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.95,0:48:45.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What did this chatterbox forget here?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.33,0:48:50.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What were you thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.56,0:48:53.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I really wanted to see her face.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.87,0:48:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Correct. I...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.14,0:49:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,In Joseon I...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.47,0:49:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Ms. Hong Young.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.51,0:49:08.01,Default,,0,0,0,,queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.12,0:49:14.22,Default,,0,0,0,,He wanted to see your maid.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.35,0:49:18.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Does he really not recognize me like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.23,0:49:24.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You said you would protect the queen,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.50,0:49:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,but only showed their vulnerability.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.53,0:49:30.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you so unhappy?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.13,0:49:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Detective department?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.87,0:49:34.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you up to something?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.64,0:49:36.67,Default,,0,0,0,,What could I be up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.78,0:49:43.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Many warehouses have been robbed in the capital recently.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.25,0:49:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,-So what?\N-We need to strengthen security measures.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.58,0:49:49.29,Default,,0,0,0,,But if you prevent this,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.25,0:49:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,is it possible that you make money from this?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.13,0:49:59.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Easy, despite his past,\N he is still a king.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.33,0:50:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Today we’ll find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.37,0:50:09.84,Default,Tira,0,0,0,,Very glad.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.85,0:50:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I myself am a skilled warrior, and I have the right instincts,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.72,0:50:29.23,Default,,0,0,0,,it wouldn’t be too difficult\N for me to dodge the blows.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.46,0:50:32.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to discuss something with you,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.60,0:50:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,that’s why I asked you to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.13,0:50:37.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes? That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.57,0:50:41.47,Default,,0,0,0,,And I also have one request for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.17,0:50:44.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I don’t know if I can ask for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.24,0:50:48.65,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of request?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.18,0:50:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you blow on my bruises?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.19,0:51:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Even your breath is fragrant.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.83,0:51:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I’m completely confused, what now
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.30,0:51:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,experiencing.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.94,0:51:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,There's only one way to know for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.78,0:51:20.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry in advance.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.31,0:51:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,But I have to find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.66,0:51:35.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.93,0:51:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry for not recognizing such an important husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.76,0:51:42.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of smile is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.97,0:51:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,A smile with which I beg for forgiveness.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.27,0:51:48.57,Default,,0,0,0,,My breath is fragrant, and my smile is even more beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.93,0:52:12.13,Default,,0,0,0,,And you know a lot about drinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.04,0:52:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You yourself tolerate alcohol quite well.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.44,0:52:28.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, that’s why I’m the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.24,0:53:01.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Have they drunk that much already?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.48,0:53:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, here it is, that’s the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.38,0:53:08.79,Default,,0,0,0,,-ERV.\N-ERV?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.09,0:53:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Time of the dog and the wolf.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.62,0:53:14.52,Default,,0,0,0,,The hour when all the veils are torn off,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.80,0:53:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,those that peacefully coexisted during the day\N squabble like dogs and wolves.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.45,0:53:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Answer me as husband to husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.76,0:53:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You’re nothing
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.33,0:53:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,don’t you have feelings for my queen?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.76,0:53:56.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Only feelings for her
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.03,0:53:58.27,Default,,0,0,0,,may explain your hostility towards me.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.27,0:54:02.87,Default,,0,0,0,,There are all kinds of donkeys in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.67,0:54:07.11,Default,,0,0,0,,There are those who themselves\N do not feel anything for the virgin,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.65,0:54:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,but they can’t allow her to be with someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.42,0:54:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I the bossy ass?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.50,0:54:33.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Beside you is the best of women,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.17,0:54:34.87,Default,,0,0,0,,and you don’t notice it.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.74,0:54:39.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Like eating a donkey, a complete fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.31,0:54:44.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Easy, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.11,0:54:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not interested in any of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.85,0:54:49.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You're lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.22,0:54:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.69,0:54:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Look into my eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.37,0:55:03.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Or you...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.94,0:55:17.05,Default,,0,0,0,,A wise king should be complacent,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.58,0:55:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,but victory is mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.69,0:55:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.02,0:55:28.53,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time for you to repay my kindness.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.20,0:56:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we meet again.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.27,0:56:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Although I tried to stay away,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.17,0:56:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,so as not to bother you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.04,0:56:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, Queen Mother, you don’t bother me at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.77,0:56:17.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a gift for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.59,0:56:33.59,Default,,0,0,0,,This...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.59,0:56:36.93,Default,,0,0,0,,If anyone deserves to be near the king, it’s you.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.59,0:56:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,The title of Her Majesty suits you much better.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.94,0:56:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What were you looking at, child?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.11,0:57:00.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Admired the reflection of the moon in the waters.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.38,0:57:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Many scary stories can be heard within the walls of the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.05,0:57:06.39,Default,,0,0,0,,About ghosts, for example.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.62,0:57:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,One of these stories says that you should not
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.53,0:57:15.73,Default,,0,0,0,,look into the waters of the reservoir when the moon is full.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.63,0:57:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Because as soon as you turn away,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.44,0:57:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,and your reflection will take on a life of its own.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.81,0:57:31.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I think
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.45,0:57:34.75,Default,,0,0,0,,as if until now I was somewhere at the bottom of a reservoir.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.62,0:57:42.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Now
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.23,0:57:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,it’s time to surface.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.55,0:58:39.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I could have waited for the elder.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.05,0:58:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like it was pressed hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.42,0:58:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop. The needy is on that side.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.93,0:59:26.73,Default,,0,0,0,,There is something that I hid from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.93,0:59:29.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What I kept secret from everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.87,0:59:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What only I and Her Majesty know.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.78,0:59:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,During the full moon, werewolves turn
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.68,0:59:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,in wolves.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.32,0:59:48.85,Default,,0,0,0,,However, we all
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.45,0:59:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,we know very well that the full moon is just an excuse,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.06,0:59:58.03,Default,,0,0,0,,to release the wolf that has always been hiding inside.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.96,1:00:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it, a chamber pot?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.13,1:00:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s no good doing things in such beauty.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.47,1:01:44.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Tango?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.77,1:02:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you come to your senses?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.01,1:02:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Take me to Her Majesty's chambers.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.14,1:02:27.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I will guard her personally.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.04,1:03:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Queen?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.47,1:03:31.31,Default,,0,0,0,,What a bastard, why are you offending my poor king?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.28,1:03:36.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I bear retribution
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.88,1:03:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,in the name of the moon!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.00,1:03:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I only drank a little,\Nand my grace became like a potato.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.36,1:03:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, get up. Still good?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.24,1:04:04.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you expose yourself to attack?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.01,1:04:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,There he is!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.15,1:04:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's forget about distancing today.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.43,1:04:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.50,1:04:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.14,1:05:12.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't help but get into trouble.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.91,1:05:16.31,Default,,0,0,0,,It would be very unfortunate if you forgot last night.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.41,1:05:18.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You can always buy a nameplate.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.28,1:05:20.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Who knows? Suddenly he is under someone else's guise
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.25,1:05:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,sneaked here to start a rebellion.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.02,1:05:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all my fault.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.82,1:05:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I had to keep my mouth shut.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.96,1:05:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's make a small foray.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.26,1:05:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Ingratiates himself with the Kims,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.96,1:05:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,that almost his entire family was slaughtered.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.66,1:05:32.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Speak, but don’t talk.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.96,1:05:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,-Who else are you? \N-I
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.50,1:05:37.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I am a member of the king’s fan club.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,


